{"words": [{"text": "يَسْـَٔلُكَ", "translation": "Ask you"}, {"text": "أَهْلُ", "translation": "(the) People"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "translation": "(of) the Book"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "تُنَزِّلَ", "translation": "you bring down"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "كِتَـٰبًۭا", "translation": "a book"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَآءِ ۚ", "translation": "the heaven"}, {"text": "فَقَدْ", "translation": "Then indeed"}, {"text": "سَأَلُوا۟", "translation": "they (had) asked"}, {"text": "مُوسَىٰٓ", "translation": "Musa"}, {"text": "أَكْبَرَ", "translation": "greater"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "than"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "فَقَالُوٓا۟", "translation": "for they said"}, {"text": "أَرِنَا", "translation": "Show us"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "جَهْرَةًۭ", "translation": "manifestly"}, {"text": "فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ", "translation": "so struck them"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّـٰعِقَةُ", "translation": "the thunderbolt"}, {"text": "بِظُلْمِهِمْ ۚ", "translation": "for their wrongdoing"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "Then"}, {"text": "ٱتَّخَذُوا۟", "translation": "they took"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِجْلَ", "translation": "the calf (for worship)"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "[what]"}, {"text": "جَآءَتْهُمُ", "translation": "came to them"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ", "translation": "the clear proofs"}, {"text": "فَعَفَوْنَا", "translation": "then We forgave them"}, {"text": "عَن", "translation": "for"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ ۚ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "وَءَاتَيْنَا", "translation": "And We gave"}, {"text": "مُوسَىٰ", "translation": "Musa"}, {"text": "سُلْطَـٰنًۭا", "translation": "an authority"}, {"text": "مُّبِينًۭا", "translation": "clear"}], "sahih": "The People of the Scripture ask you to bring down to them a book from the heaven. But they had asked of Moses [even] greater than that and said, \"Show us Allāh outright,\" so the thunderbolt struck them for their wrongdoing. Then they took the calf [for worship] after clear evidences had come to them, and We pardoned that. And We gave Moses a clear authority."}